      {
        "id": "f1",
        "name": "shd_rsnn.cnl",
        "content": "Define a network named shd_rsnn with timestep 0.001.\nDefine an input port named input with shape (700,).\nDefine a linear transformation named w_in_hidden with weight matrix shape (128, 700).\nDefine a RSynaptic neuron named hidden with neuron count 128, synaptic decay 0.9, membrane decay 0.8, and firing threshold 1.0.\nDefine a linear transformation named w_hidden_out with weight matrix shape (20, 128).\nDefine a Synaptic neuron named output_layer with neuron count 20, synaptic decay 0.9, membrane decay 0.8, and firing threshold 1.0.\nDefine an output port named output with shape (20,).\ninput connects to w_in_hidden.\nw_in_hidden connects to hidden.\nhidden connects to w_hidden_out.\nw_hidden_out connects to output_layer.\noutput_layer connects to output.\n"
      }
    ],
    "activeFileId": "f1",
    "workspaceName": "cel268-shd-rsnn",
    "selectedPlatforms": ["snntorch_sim"],
    "selectedDataset": "SHD"
  },
  "canvas": {
